{"id":"posredi","lemma":"посреди","pos":"prep","rank":1187,"glosses":["in the middle of, in the midst of"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/a/a9/Ru-%D0%BF%D0%BE%D1%81%D1%80%D0%B5%D0%B4%D0%B8.ogg/Ru-%D0%BF%D0%BE%D1%81%D1%80%D0%B5%D0%B4%D0%B8.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Посреди дороги стоял грузовик.","en":"A truck was standing in the middle of the road.","words":[null,{"g":"road","l":"дорога"},{"g":"to stand","l":"стоять"},{"g":"lorry, truck"}]},{"text":"Том стоял посреди комнаты.","en":"Tom was standing in the middle of the room.","words":[{"g":"that one, those ones","l":"тот"},{"g":"to stand","l":"стоять"},null,{"g":"room","l":"комната"}]},{"text":"Я проснулся посреди ночи.","en":"I woke up in the middle of the night.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to awake, to wake up","l":"проснуться"},null,{"g":"night, nighttime","l":"ночь"}]},{"text":"Машина остановилась посреди дороги.","en":"The car stopped in the middle of the road.","words":[{"g":"car, motor vehicle"},{"g":"to stop","l":"остановиться"},null,{"g":"road","l":"дорога"}]},{"text":"Иногда моя собака лает посреди ночи.","en":"Sometimes my dog barks in the middle of the night.","words":[{"g":"sometimes, at times"},{"g":"my","l":"мой"},{"g":"dog"},null,null,{"g":"night, nighttime","l":"ночь"}]}]}